{"content":[{"c":["AMMIHUD"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Father of a leader of Ephraim’s tribe, Elishama (",{"href":"?bref=Num.1.10","r":"Num.1.10","rawR":"Num.1.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.1.10","value":"Num.1.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 1:10"},"). Ammihud was Joshua’s great-grandfather (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.26","r":"1Chr.7.26","rawR":"1Chr.7.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.26","value":"1Chr.7.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Father of Shemuel from Simeon’s tribe. Shemuel helped Moses apportion the Promised Land (",{"href":"?bref=Num.34.20","r":"Num.34.20","rawR":"Num.34.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.34.20","value":"Num.34.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 34:20"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Father of Pedahel from Naphtali’s tribe. Pedahel also helped Moses apportion the Promised Land (",{"href":"?bref=Num.34.28","r":"Num.34.28","rawR":"Num.34.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.34.28","value":"Num.34.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 34:28"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Father of King Talmai of Geshur. Talmai gave refuge to Absalom when he fled after murdering Amnon (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.13.37","r":"2Sam.13.37","rawR":"2Sam.13.37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.13.37","value":"2Sam.13.37"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 13:37"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Omri’s son and father of Uthai from Judah’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.4","r":"1Chr.9.4","rawR":"1Chr.9.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.4","value":"1Chr.9.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ammihud","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 1:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.1.10","rawQueryValue":"Num.1.10","sourceRefExact":"Num.1.10"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.26","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.26","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.26"},{"anchorText":"Nm 34:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.34.20","rawQueryValue":"Num.34.20","sourceRefExact":"Num.34.20"},{"anchorText":"Nm 34:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.34.28","rawQueryValue":"Num.34.28","sourceRefExact":"Num.34.28"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 13:37","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.13.37","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.13.37","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.13.37"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.4","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.4","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.4"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"8363b3ebf148b508aae74955ccabe0268dcd8006ad1f4da24a7becb2e3170b33","sourceItemName":"Ammihud","sourceItemOrder":301,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ammihud","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ammihud","title":"Ammihud","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}